{"id":"3cd26e6e3fb18aa5","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset.md","title":"ZFC Stationary Tower Poset","display":"df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset — ZFC Stationary Tower Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset — ZFC Stationary Tower Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset — ZFC Stationary Tower Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8125f2f9d6d8a8ae\" href=\"?note=8125f2f9d6d8a8ae\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\mathbb P,p,q\\in V,\\quad p,q\\in\\mathbb P\">\\(\\delta,\\mathbb P,p,q\\in V,\\quad p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_\\delta\\;\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\">\\(\\leq_\\delta\\;\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P=\\{p\\in V_\\delta:\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\}\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P=\\{p\\in V_\\delta:\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\}\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The atom now supplies both the condition carrier and the projection order between different supports.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md","status":"resolved","id":"8125f2f9d6d8a8ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-condition.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta,\\mathbb P,p,q\\in V,\\quad p,q\\in\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_\\delta\\;\\subseteq\\mathbb P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\land\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}tower\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\\mathrm{StationaryTowerPoset}_S(\\mathbb P,\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb P=\\{p\\in V_\\delta:\\mathrm{StationaryTowerCondition}_S(p,\\delta)\\}\\land\\forall p,q\\in\\mathbb P\\;(p\\leq_\\delta q\\leftrightarrow\\bigcup q\\subseteq\\bigcup p\\land\\forall x\\in p\\;(x\\cap\\bigcup q\\in q))","display":true}],"bytes":1278,"backlinks":[{"id":"e031439b28948954","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3498","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset.md|58-df-zfc-stationary-tower-poset]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","8125f2f9d6d8a8ae"]}